WEBVTT

00:01:27.797 --> 00:01:31.097
It is clear that inequality
is at the center

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:33.363
of many of the world's problems,

00:01:33.397 --> 00:01:37.163
affecting not just the bottom
40 percent of us, but everyone.

00:01:38.163 --> 00:01:39.630
Young men and women

00:01:39.663 --> 00:01:42.930
who don't get set on the path
of equal opportunities

00:01:42.963 --> 00:01:44.163
become frustrated.

00:01:44.697 --> 00:01:47.430
And we may not like the choices they make

00:01:47.463 --> 00:01:51.630
in their attempt to get
what they think they rightly deserve

00:01:51.663 --> 00:01:54.863
or punish those that they assume
keep them away

00:01:54.863 --> 00:01:56.863
from those better opportunities.

00:01:57.397 --> 00:01:59.397
But it doesn't have to be this way

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:02.530
if we, as humanity,
make different choices.